---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactLinks from '../components/ContactLinks.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Bio" description={`About ${site.name}: 15+ years designing across digital, print and UX.`}>
  <h1 class="page-title">Bio</h1>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I was born in Charlotte, NC in 1982. I'm the oldest of four boys, and we grew up moving across
      the country. While we usually stayed somewhere along the East Coast, I spent a great few years
      in the Denver suburbs in my more formative years, which happened to be long enough to develop a
      love for Denver sports teams and mountain views. After another move back to New Jersey, I
      finished high school and moved on to study Fine Arts at Monmouth University, and I've been
      local to the Jersey Shore area since (which is not at all like the TV show… thankfully).
    </p>
    <p>
      The years on the move taught me some very valuable lessons about self-reliance and
      adaptability, both of which would prove to be really valuable professionally. In today's
      fast-paced and tech-centric life, those two skills are essential to continued learning and
      growth — especially considering my first job out of school was for a print publication.
    </p>
    <p>
      Throughout my 15+ years of experience, I'm most proud of the wide range of skills I've
      developed working across digital, print, UX and even some development. In 2021, I continued
      developing skills, earning several online certifications specifically in UX/UI Design.
    </p>

    <h2>Other interests</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Heavy metal</li>
      <li>Trying different craft beer with friends</li>
      <li>Photography</li>
      <li>Travel</li>
      <li>Fitness</li>
      <li>Hanging with my wife and pandemic pup Stout</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>The best ways to reach me:</p>
    <ContactLinks />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
